# Build context is the repository root (the uv workspace lives here). Only
# the API's runtime files are copied into the image; keep everything else,
# and every secret, out of the context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
apps
docs
infra
services/api/tests
services/api/eval
